downloads/
download/
analysis_output/
keyframes/
transcripts/
*.mp4
*.webm
*.mkv
*.m4a
*.mp3
*.wav
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
!dashboard/*.png
*.webp
*.part
*.ytdl

# Private Data & Chat Archives (Strict Isolation)
*WhatsApp*
*telegram*
*discord*
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.7z
*.private.csv
*.local.csv
batch_raw/
temp/
tmp/

